'''Incineroar''' (Japanese: '''ガオガエン''' ''Gaogaen'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

