==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Incineroar|26}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion; both cards have the Darkest Lariat attack.
*{{m|Darkest Lariat}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Incineroar}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

